/**
 * Parity tests for the model catalog against a frozen fixture generated by
 * driving the real `shore_common::config`.
 *
 * Unlike every earlier port in this series, the fixture was generated from
 * `main` rather than a detached worktree: `shore-common` still compiles, so
 * this pins current behaviour instead of behaviour from the last green daemon
 * commit.
 */

